    "Details": "The AS8-KE is the export version of the AS8-K, which uses a Standard engine as Draconis Combine were not keen on on exporting the Extra Light engine equipped Assault 'Mechs to its neighbors and also as a means of reducing the price. To reduce the weight all the secondary weaponry was removed, leaving only the ER Large Lasers, MML-5 launcher and the Gauss Rifle.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
